NOTES ON THE COGNITIVE SKILLS
--------------------------------
The cognitive/ skills are based on the IDEAS of published books:
  - Scarcity: Why Having Too Little Means So Much,
    by Sendhil Mullainathan and Eldar Shafir
  - Deep Work: Rules for Focused Success in a Distracted World,
    by Cal Newport

We do NOT reproduce or translate excerpts of the original works.
What is licensed here is our own contribution:
  - translating the ideas into executable rules for AI agents
  - our own engineering data and validation records
    (e.g. cognitive/bandwidth-and-deep-work/references/evidence.md)

